    "short_description": "Shapefighter is an arcade-style, twin-stick shooter where you blast through 5 stages of pure shape onslaught. Shoot and dodge shapes that will swarm you in a ever-changing formations. Defeat all 5 bosses and take down the shape invasion!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cFrom a solo developed twin-stick shooter perspective, this is top tier adrenaline, arcade action that just plays beautifully. With a thumping soundtrack and Geometry Wars style neon graphics pulsating around you. What's not to love? This is a classic in the making and I have two hearty thumbs up for Shapefighter.\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 Higher Plain Games<br>",
